DESCRIPTION:The amazing RACHEL FEINSTEIN returns to VCC!\n\nGREAT IF YOU 
 ENJOY...\nSarah Silverman\, Beth Stelling\n\nSHOWS :\nFri\, Oct 16th @ 7pm 
